  speakerSprites:
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: f3f229a9dc844814da08eab1e3dd6299, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 433f75f2fdaa60948b8f45ad0a1859d2, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 470dc91e34c80744e88dcae0e387fbc4, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1599abee4fed5634fb3a9fca33be6f63, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 23e5f2966eef2b24994544422b320027, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6afe3efb80fb72a40abd765373f6598b, type: 3}
  sceneStills:
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3a9ef1041e533494cb1d9dac226293ef, type: 3}
  directions:
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Mystery Man
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 3
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "They\u2019re gonna kill me\u2026 they\u2019re trying to kill me\u2026\r\n"
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Mystery Man
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 3
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "Breathe my friend\u2026\r\n"
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Mystery Man
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 1
    rightSpeakerIdx: 3
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "Stay back! Stay back, OK?! Who are you? Huh? \r"
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Mystery Man
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 1
    rightSpeakerIdx: 3
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "You\u2019re closer to the answer than you\u2019ve ever been\u2026 "
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Mystery Man
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 1
    rightSpeakerIdx: 3
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: Shut up, ok, just shut up with that shit and tell me who you are!
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Mystery Man
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 1
    rightSpeakerIdx: 3
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "Very well my friend\u2026\r\n"
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Mystery Man
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 2
    rightSpeakerIdx: 3
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "Oh, oh man am I glad to see you!\r"
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Ramesh
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 2
    rightSpeakerIdx: 4
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "Likewise brother.\r"
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Ramesh
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 2
    rightSpeakerIdx: 4
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: 'I thought you left?

'
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Ramesh
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 2
    rightSpeakerIdx: 5
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "I did, but something didn\u2019t sit right with me. I started researching
      the company here."
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Ramesh
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 5
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: I looked up names, manufacturing contracts, and everything traced back
      to the Department of Defense.
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Ramesh
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 5
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: 'I felt I should tell you. '
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Ramesh
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 5
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "The DOD?! What\u2019re they doing here?\r\n"
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Ramesh
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 5
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "I don\u2019t know, but if anyone can find out, it\u2019s you, Uwe."
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Ramesh
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 5
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: A construction company was one thing, but how am I supposed to stop
      the military?
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Ramesh
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 5
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "You\u2019re gonna surf, and keep surfing, and never stop surfing,
      with style."
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Ramesh
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 2
    rightSpeakerIdx: 5
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "I suppose there\u2019s no other choice then. I\u2019ve gotta ask,
      how did you learn about surf tricks?\r\n"
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Ramesh
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 2
    rightSpeakerIdx: 5
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: How do you think I ended up here? I opened up the Juice Bar to support
      my surfing endeavors. I was quite the athlete in my day
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Ramesh
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 2
    rightSpeakerIdx: 5
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: Huh, go figure. Why the secrecy though? Why hide your identity from
      me?
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Ramesh
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 2
    rightSpeakerIdx: 5
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: 'Old Indian Custom.

'
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Ramesh
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 2
    rightSpeakerIdx: 5
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: 'Good enough for me.

'
